@startuml
actor Engineer
actor Reviewer
participant "UI / signer service" as App
participant "Assurance contract" as Contract
actor Analyst
Engineer -> App : import six lab records
App -> Contract : recordLab x6 [Engineer signer]
Reviewer -> App : rationale + expiry
App -> Contract : approveLimited [Reviewer signer]
Contract --> App : DecisionRecorded(snapshot)
Analyst -> App : 8/4000 baseline, 12/4000 post
App -> Contract : recordField [Analyst signer]
Contract -> Contract : invalidate decision; evaluate rate
Contract --> App : ReviewReopened + ActionOpened
Analyst -> App : improved field comparison
App -> Contract : recordField [Analyst signer]
note right of Contract : Action stays open
Reviewer -> App : resolution + closure rationale
App -> Contract : closeAction
note right of Contract : No release authority yet
Reviewer -> App : separate expansion judgment
App -> Contract : approveExpansion
Contract --> App : DecisionRecorded(new snapshot)
@enduml
